<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n15300" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ef-fūtĭo</span></b> , no <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>perf.</i>,
				ītum, 4, v. a.
			FVTIO, acc. to <i><span class="en">Prisc. p. 631</span></i>
			P., <i>to blab out</i>, <i>babble
				forth</i>, <i>to prate</i>, <i>chatter</i>, <i>utter</i> (class.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">multa ore,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Lucr.
					5, 910</span></i>
			; so, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aliquid,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					N. D. 1, 30, 84</span></i>
			; * <i><span class="en">Hor. A. P. 231</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Gell. 5,
			1</span></i>; cf.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">effutita temere (vaticinia),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic. Div. 2, 55, 113</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">de mundo,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					N. D. 2, 37, 94</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>
				<i>Absol.</i>
			</b>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense5"><b>(a).</b>
			<i>To blab</i>, <i>tell secrets</i>: eo
			perperam olim dixi, ne vos foris effutiretis; and <i>absol.</i>, <i><span class="en">Ter. Ph. 5, 1,
			19</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense5"><b>(b).</b>
			<i>To talk idly</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ex tempore,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Tusc. 5, 31, 88</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
